on’t. Under each image, note what to borrow — the light, the colour, the composition — so the board guides decisions rather than just looking nice.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c5","type":"note","x":56,"y":354,"w":308,"h":127,"title":"The feeling","body":"Brass in the sunshine. Posters you can hear. Bold, overlapping shapes that feel cut out by hand, not drawn on a screen.","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c6","type":"note","x":56,"y":497,"w":308,"h":107,"title":"Words","body":"Syncopated · warm · cut-paper · riverside · late summer","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c7","type":"note","x":56,"y":620,"w":308,"h":127,"title":"Graphic idea","body":"Every instrument becomes a simple cut-paper shape. Shapes overlap and bounce off the grid like notes off the beat.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c8","type":"image","x":420,"y":299,"w":560,"h":460,"title":"Energy — borrow the brass and the light","body":"Photo: Tress-Jazz-in-Tygmont-AB — Chepry 💬 ( Andrzej Barabasz ) 📷 🇵🇱. CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tress-Jazz-in-Tygmont-AB.jpg","media":"@image:ph-gd-jazz-band","filename":"ph-gd-jazz-band.jpg","boardId":null},{"id":"graphicdesignmoodboard-c9","type":"image","x":1020,"y":299,"w":270,"h":243,"title":"Layering on the street","body":"Photo: Countless Layers (42253326314) — Diego Torres Silvestre from Sao Paulo, Brazil. CC BY 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"pap